# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ⚠ NEVER ADD THESE HERE ⚠
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Do NOT place any of the following in this file or any .env.* committed to
# source control:
#
#   - Database connection strings (Postgres, MongoDB URIs, etc.)
#   - Private API keys (OpenAI, Stripe secret keys, Twilio auth tokens, etc.)
#   - OAuth client secrets / JWT signing secrets
#   - Cloud IAM credentials (AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, GCP service account JSON)
#   - Firebase Admin SDK private keys
#
# These must only exist in a server-side runtime environment (e.g., Vercel
# serverless function env, GitHub Actions secrets, or a backend .env that is
# NEVER committed).
# ==============================================================================
